    "sub_ename": "OFF-CAMPUS INTERNSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "本課程藉由遴選程序媒合學生至產業進行實務接軌，以驗證所學之知識。其目的在加強理論與實務的整合，以強化學生解決問題的能力，提升未來就業競爭力。",
    "describe_eh": "The course is designed to offer students access to include work experience as part of their study through selection procedure. It aims to integrate the theory and practice in order to strengthen the problem solving ability and the competitiveness of students.",
